;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--amber);border:1px solid var(--amber);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px}\n\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:40px 0 60px;background:#08223c;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\n.foot-grid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.foot-grid b{color:#fff;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px}\n.foot-bottom{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px}\n\n@media (max-width:860px){\n  .hero-title,.hero-quote{grid-column:span 12}\n  .hero-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .cards,.steps,.clients,.faq-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .plan-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}\n}\n</style><main>\n<header class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <div class=\"hero-mast\">\n      <span>蓝域 · LanYu 创刊号</span>\n      <nav class=\"hero-tags\" aria-label=\"页面锚点\">\n        <a href=\"#overview\">概览</a>\n        <a href=\"#plans\">套餐</a>\n        <a href=\"#usage\">使用</a>\n        <a href=\"#clients\">客户端</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-title\">\n      <h1>LanYu · 让带宽，<br>像<span>潮汐</span>一样稳定。</h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">蓝域不是最快的口号，而是一套被反复校准的线路调度。日常浏览、原生流媒体、企业团队，三种节奏，一份协议。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"hero-quote\">\n      <div class=\"q-mark\">“</div>\n      <p>稳定的网络不该靠运气，它应像潮汐，有规律，有余量，可预期。</p>\n      <div class=\"src\">— 蓝域调度日志卷首语</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-cols\">\n      <article class=\"hero-col\">\n        <h3>调度</h3>\n        <p>按地区、运营商、负载动态择路。高峰期自动切换备用出口。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"hero-col\">\n        <h3>解锁</h3>\n        <p>原生流媒体直接走住宅出口，不靠 DNS 篡改，画质不被降级。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"hero-col\">\n        <h3>账目</h3>\n        <p>流量按月清零，超额可加购。年付账户赠送等额时长。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section id=\"overview\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">本期专题</div>\n        <h2>三件事，决定一次连接的质量</h2>\n      </div>\n      <span>2024 / 卷 03</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n        <h3>出口干净</h3>\n        <p>蓝域不把同一段 IP 卖给成百上千人。每条出口维护低密度，避免被识别为机房流量，从源头减少风控。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n        <h3>路由可控</h3>\n        <p>IPLC 专线不走公网穿越，时延由物理路径决定。高峰时段也不会出现普通中转常见的丢包塌陷。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n        <h3>配置透明</h3>\n        <p>客户端显示当前节点负载、丢包率与出口类型。不靠“加速”两个字蒙混，数字摆在界面上。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"plans\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">阶梯套餐</div>\n        <h2>从个人到团队，按节奏升级</h2>\n      </div>\n      <span>阶梯递进 · 可随时升降</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans\">\n      <article class=\"plan\">\n        <div class=\"plan-row\">\n          <h3>基础版</h3>\n          <div class=\"price\">¥15<small>每月 · 按年付仅需 ¥150/年</small></div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>3 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n            <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan featured\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">推荐</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-row\">\n          <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n          <div class=\"price\">¥35<small>每月 · 按年付仅需 ¥350/年</small></div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>5 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n            <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n            <li>7×24 优先工单支持</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan\">\n        <div class=\"plan-row\">\n          <h3>团队版</h3>\n          <div class=\"price\">¥85<small>每月 · 按年付仅需 ¥850/年</small></div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n            <li>20 台设备同时在线</li>\n            <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n            <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n            <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"usage\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">使用说明</div>\n        <h2>四步开始，不用读手册</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"n\">01</div>\n        <h3>选套餐</h3>\n        <p>基础版适合浏览，旗舰版覆盖流媒体与游戏，团队版供多人协作。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"n\">02</div>\n        <h3>装客户端</h3>\n        <p>Windows、macOS、Android、iOS 均有原生应用。登录即同步配置。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"n\">03</div>\n        <h3>挑节点</h3>\n        <p>客户端按地区与用途分组。看流媒体选住宅出口，玩游戏选 IPLC。</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"n\">04</div>\n        <h3>看用量</h3>\n        <p>仪表盘实时显示剩余流量与当前连接质量。超额可一键加购。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"clients\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">客户端</div>\n        <h2>每个平台，原生支持</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"clients\">\n      <article class=\"client\">\n        <h3>Windows 客户端</h3>\n        <p>支持 Windows 10 及以上。含分流规则、开机自启、TUN 模式。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">系统要求 · Win 10 / 11 · x64</div>\n        <a class=\"dl\" href=\"#\">查看下载</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"client\">\n        <h3>macOS 客户端</h3>\n        <p>支持 Apple Silicon 与 Intel。菜单栏快捷开关，支持 Universal。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">系统要求 · macOS 12+ · 通用</div>\n        <a class=\"dl\" href=\"#\">查看下载</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"client\">\n        <h3>Android 客户端</h3>\n        <p>支持 Android 8 及以上。含小部件、按应用分流、节电策略。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">系统要求 · Android 8+</div>\n        <a class=\"dl\" href=\"#\">查看下载</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"client\">\n        <h3>iOS 客户端</h3>\n        <p>支持 iOS 15 及以上。与 macOS 共享配置，支持 Shortcut 自动化。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">系统要求 · iOS 15+</div>\n        <a class=\"dl\" href=\"#\">查看下载</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"kicker\">常见问题</div>\n        <h2>先问后买，不踩坑</h2>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-grid\">\n      <div class=\"faq-group\">\n        <h3>关于套餐与计费</h3>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">流量每月清零还是累计？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">每月清零。例如基础版每月 100GB，未用完部分不结转。可随时加购流量包。</div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">年付赠送的时长怎么到账？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">支付年付后，账户有效期自动延长两个月。例如旗舰版年付为 ¥350，实际有效期 14 个月。</div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">套餐之间可以升降吗？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">可以。升补差价，降按剩余周期折算。团队版降级需确认设备数不超出新套餐上限。</div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-group\">\n        <h3>关于线路与设备</h3>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">旗舰版与基础版的节点有什么不同？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">基础版使用共享节点池，旗舰版与团队版享有原生住宅出口与 IPLC 专线，优先级更高。</div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">设备数超出上限会怎样？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">超出时新设备无法登录，已连接设备不受影响。可在管理端强制下线旧设备。</div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">路由器能用吗？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">团队版支持企业定制路由，可部署到兼容 OpenWrt 与软路由的设备。基础版与旗舰版建议在终端使用。</div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-group\">\n        <h3>关于售后</h3>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">工单多久回复？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">旗舰版与团队版为优先工单，通常 2 小时内响应。基础版 24 小时内响应。</div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"faq-item\">\n          <div class=\"q\">试用或退款政策？</div>\n          <div class=\"a\">蓝域不提供免费试用。新账户在首次连接后 24 小内如节点完全不可用，可申请全额退款，需附连接日志。</div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"foot-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <b>蓝域 LanYu</b>\n        深海蓝配琥珀的网络加速服务。\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <b>导航</b>\n        <a href=\"#overview\">概览</a> ·\n        <a href=\"#plans\">套餐</a> ·\n        <a href=\"#usage\">使用</a> ·\n        <a href=\"#clients\">客户端</a> ·\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <b>声明</b>\n        服务仅供合规网络访问使用。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-bottom\">© 蓝域 LanYu。页面内容为品牌介绍，不构成交易要约。</div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
